WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.698
Hi, friends. Gani here. This is My Values Compass.

00:00:12.698 --> 00:00:17.396
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:17.396 --> 00:00:20.215
Hands resting on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:20.215 --> 00:00:23.034
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:23.034 --> 00:00:31.491
A compass helps travelers pick a direction when the road is hard to read.

00:00:31.491 --> 00:00:39.948
You have a compass inside you. Its points are the things that matter most to you.

00:00:39.948 --> 00:00:45.586
Kindness might be one point. Honesty. Helping. Courage. Or a word of your own.

00:00:45.586 --> 00:00:49.344
Picture it with eyes closed, or eyes open, looking at your desk. Both ways work.

00:00:49.344 --> 00:00:58.741
Now name your points, silently, one by one. Start with one thing that matters to you.

00:00:58.741 --> 00:01:05.318
Maybe: being kind. Maybe: telling the truth, even when it is hard.

00:01:05.318 --> 00:01:13.775
Maybe: helping when someone needs it. Or being brave, and trying new things.

00:01:13.775 --> 00:01:23.171
Three or four points. In your words. No point is wrong, and none is graded.

00:01:23.171 --> 00:01:33.507
Now, one pretend hard choice. A new child is standing alone, and your game is already fun.

00:01:33.507 --> 00:01:39.145
Check your compass. Which point speaks up? Kindness points one way: invite them in.

00:01:39.145 --> 00:01:45.723
You do not have to fix every hard choice. Just notice which direction your compass points.

00:01:45.723 --> 00:01:51.360
The choice is still yours. The compass just helps you see the road.

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:57.938
Your compass goes with you — to class, to the playground, to home.

00:01:57.938 --> 00:02:05.455
That is My Values Compass. What matters to you can show you the way.

00:02:05.455 --> 00:02:08.274
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:02:08.274 --> 00:02:12.032
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:02:12.032 --> 00:02:15.791
You're ready for what's next.
